From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: LibreELEC H616 contributor
Date: Mon Oct 20 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] sunxi: h616: Add DDR3L v5.1 DRAM/PMIC parameters for X96Q

The hechuang X96Q v5.1 board (H616 + 2GB DDR3L) ships in volume alongside
the original amediatech X96Q, but differs in two ways that matter during
SPL boot:

1. DRAM timing.  With the generic parameters in configs/x96q_defconfig,
   DRAM initialisation fails on the v5.1 board.

2. PMIC.  The v5.1 uses an AXP313 (not the AXP305 of the original board)
   and needs DCDC3 programmed to 1.36V for the DDR3L rail before DRAM
   training.  Without AXP313 support the SPL leaves the DRAM rail at its
   default and training fails regardless of timing parameters.

Set the DRAM and PMIC parameters measured for this variant, identical to
the values shipped in Armbian's linux-u-boot-x96q-v5-1 package and derived
from warpme/minimyth2 and the X96Q DDR3L v5.1 bring-up work (zra123).

Tested on hardware: with this patch u-boot 2026.10 SPL initialises DRAM
and boots the v5.1 board (blue power LED, kernel handoff), which fails
with the stock parameters.

+++ b/configs/x96q_defconfig
@@ -5,13 +5,14 @@ CONFIG_DRAM_CLK=600
 CONFIG_SPL=y
 CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_DX_ODT=0x03030303
 CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_DX_DRI=0x0e0e0e0e
-CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_CA_DRI=0x1f12
-CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR0=0xc0001002
-CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR2=0x00000100
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_ODT_EN=0x1
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_CA_DRI=0x00001c12
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR0=0xc0000a05
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR2=0x00000000
 CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR6=0x33808080
-CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR10=0x002f0107
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR10=0x002f0006
 CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR11=0xddddcccc
-CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR12=0xeddc7665
+CONFIG_DRAM_SUNXI_TPR12=0xeddc7564
 CONFIG_MACH_SUN50I_H616=y
 CONFIG_SUNXI_H616_INTERNAL_EPHY=y
 CONFIG_SUNXI_DRAM_H616_DDR3_1333=y
@@ -24,6 +25,9 @@ CONFIG_SYS_I2C_MVTWSI=y
 CONFIG_SYS_I2C_SPEED=400000
 CONFIG_SUPPORT_EMMC_BOOT=y
 CONFIG_SUN8I_EMAC=y
-CONFIG_AXP305_POWER=y
+CONFIG_AXP313_POWER=y
+CONFIG_AXP_DCDC3_VOLT=1360
+CONFIG_I2C3_ENABLE=y
+CONFIG_PHY_REALTEK=y
 CONFIG_USB_EHCI_HCD=y
 CONFIG_USB_OHCI_HCD=y
